@startuml UC-51
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-51.md
title UC-51: Update Stock
footer Feature INV-01 | Business rules: BR-07, BR-17
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Staff / Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/InventoryController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "InventoryService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Staff, Admin

U -> MVC : Enter new stock quantity for a variant
MVC -> API : PUT /api/admin/variants/{id}/stock\n{ stockQuantity, expectedCurrentStock }
API -> SVC : UpdateStockAsync(id, request)
alt stockQuantity < 0 (BR-17)
  SVC --> API : BadRequest
  API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request
  MVC --> U : Show "Stock cannot be negative"
else valid
  SVC -> DB : UPDATE ProductVariants SET StockQuantity = @new\nWHERE VariantId = @id AND StockQuantity = @expected
  alt 0 rows affected (an order changed the stock meanwhile)
    SVC -> DB : Read current StockQuantity
    SVC --> API : Conflict (current stock)
    API --> MVC : 409 Conflict
    MVC --> U : Show current stock, ask to re-enter
  else updated
    SVC --> API : OK
    API --> MVC : 204 No Content
    MVC --> U : Show new stock
  end
end

@enduml
